  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reforming Audiovisual Media Regulation in Ukraine in line with EU standards and international best practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this programme is to enhance the efficiency, transparency, and consistency of the media policy in Ukraine. This objective will be achieved through closer alignment with the EU media framework and by strengthening the independence of the National Council. Additionally, the legal, regulatory, and administrative capacity of the National Council will be enhanced to enable them to take appropriate regulatory measures as required by the legal framework of Ukraine and EU.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
